Perhatikan generator function berikut:
function* gen() {
  const x = yield 1;
  yield x * 2;
}
const g = gen();
console.log(g.next().value);
console.log(g.next(5).value);
Berapa output yang dicetak berturut-turut?

Perhatikan kode iterator kustom berikut:
const range = {
  from: 1, to: 3,
  [Symbol.iterator]() {
    let current = this.from;
    const last = this.to;
    return {
      next() {
        return current <= last ? { value: current++, done: false } : { done: true };
      }
    };
  }
};
console.log([...range]);
Berapa hasil evaluasinya?
